# A very unstable balance (set for this test only) and no correction: falls off the ledge.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
cmd 0 setData physics.grind.balanceInstability 40
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
run 500
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50} within 172..190
expect event grindEnd{reason=balance} within 180..300
expect event bail within 180..300
expect no event comboLanded
expect event danger{why=grind balance} within 230..250
